{
  "id": "section-853",
  "title": "讨论“工矿十条”时的讲话",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-233.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>233)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　先有事实，然后有概念。没有事实，怎么能形成概念？没有实际，那能有理论？有时理论和实际是并行的，有时理论先行，但是实际总归是第一位。工人不先把革命闹起来，那儿来的几条规定？<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-232.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-234.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
